# OrfeoError grammar spec.
#
# Each line of OrfeoError is followed by its expected colors, one letter
# per character. Spaces line up with the spaces in the line above.
#
#   H  header               E  eject icon
#   L  line number          S  sequence start icon
#   .  must stay uncolored
#
# This block, down to the first blank line, is not tested.

# OrfeoError Syntax Highlighter Tests
. .......... ...... ........... .....
# v0.2.0
. ......
# Copyright 2024 Pierre-Emmanuel Lévesque
. ......... .... ............... ........

    # With eject icon ------------------------------------------------
    . .... ..... .... ................................................

===OOPS!=== Error at 1:3
HHHHHHHHHHH ..... .. ...
1➤ ( ⏏@ )
LL . E. .
Empty marker.
..... .......
You must write a marker name after the marker sigil ｢@｣.
... .... ..... . ...... .... ..... ... ...... ..... ....

    # With sequence start icon until EOL -----------------------------
    . .... ........ ..... .... ..... ... .............................

===OOPS!=== Error between 1:6 and EOL
HHHHHHHHHHH ..... ....... ... ... ...
1➤ note ⭢<abc
LL .... S....
Unexpected end of line.
.......... ... .. .....
The note container opened at 1:6 is not closed.
... .... ......... ...... .. ... .. ... .......

    # With sequence start icon until EOF -----------------------------
    . .... ........ ..... .... ..... ... .............................

===OOPS!=== Error between 1:6 and EOF
HHHHHHHHHHH ..... ....... ... ... ...
1➤ note ⭢#(
LL .... S..
Unexpected end of file.
.......... ... .. .....
The block comment opened at 1:6 is not closed.
... ..... ....... ...... .. ... .. ... .......

