HHHHHHHHHHH ..... .. ....
12➤ ( ⏏@ )
LLL . E. .
10➤ ( ⏏@ )
LLL . E. .
12➤ note ⭢<abc
LLL .... S....
Empty marker.
..... .......
You must write a marker name after the marker sigil ｢@｣.
